# Stream apply order, shared by every repo in this carrier (apply.sh reads it
# once and applies it inside each repo's patches/<repo>/ dir).
#
# Both streams are comment-only. `docs` (explanatory KDoc) applies before
# `book` (Sphinx doc-region markers), so any doc-region markers are placed
# against the already-documented tree. They can touch overlapping files, so the
# order is pinned rather than left to alphabetical chance.
#
# One stream per line; listed streams apply first, in this order. Comments and
# blank lines are ignored.
docs
book
